      "value": "@{5f2e0a4e8464150716ffd322|full_name} the idea is that we do not need to make a special constraint for it. This feature would be applied to the full body mode only, since you don't need to do it for Half body and Desktop. That and the issues with y rotation locking when your model is lying down.",
